  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`text_contains`](https://processes.openeo.org/#text_contains) \u2014 *Text contains another text*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `text_contains`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nChecks whether the text (also known as *string*) specified for `data` contains the text specified for `pattern`. No-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`text_contains`](https://processes.openeo.org/#text_contains) ([openeo-processes/text_contains.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/text_contains.json)).\n",
